==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[main]] [[diagonal]]}}

# {{context|linear algebra}} The (imagined) diagonal line from the top left to the bottom right of a [[square matrix]].
#: {{usex|In a diagonal matrix, non-zero elements appear only on the '''main diagonal'''.|lang=en}}

